From 7833bae4449bb37c028642aaef8e809a8ce5e776 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:05:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Add previous and next event links to the show page

Event::previous() and Event::next() find the neighbor by starts_on with
id as tie-breaker, in SQL inside the model. The admin show page links to
them and hides the link at the ends.
---
